\"Primary navigation\"><button data-testid=\"nav-products\">PRODUCTS <span>⌄</span></button><button data-testid=\"nav-solutions\">SOLUTIONS <span>⌄</span></button><a data-testid=\"nav-lumimorph\" href=\"/lumimorph\">LUMIMORPH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-naturatex\" href=\"/naturatex\">NATURATEX</a><a data-testid=\"nav-signatouch\" href=\"/signatouch\">SIGNATOUCH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-glassmorph\" href=\"/glassmorph\">GLASSMORPH</a><button data-testid=\"nav-more-btn\">☰ <span>⌄</span></button></nav><button class=\"mobile-menu-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" data-testid=\"mobile-menu-toggle\">☰</button></div></header><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"SculptLED Ribbon Flex\", \"description\": \"Ultra-flexible LED strip that bends to any organic shape. Minimum bend radius of 50mm enables wrapping around columns, creating waves, spirals, and freeform sculptures. Silicone encapsulation provides IP67 waterproofing. Individually addressable pixels allow complex animations across sculptural forms.\", \"sku\": \"BL-ART-SRF\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/sculptled-ribbon-flex\", \"category\": \"art-immersive\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_sculptled-ribbon-flex.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/sculptled-ribbon-flex\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"10mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"2000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the minimum bend radius for SculptLED Ribbon Flex?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The SculptLED Ribbon Flex has a minimum bend radius of 50mm, allowing it to wrap smoothly around tight curves such as columns and freeform sculptural shapes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the SculptLED Ribbon Flex suitable for outdoor installations?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It features an IP67 rating with silicone encapsulation, ensuring full waterproof and dustproof protection, which makes it ideal for outdoor artistic and architectural installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does per-pixel addressability benefit my design?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Per-pixel addressability allows you to control each LED individually, enabling complex animations and dynamic visual effects across organic sculptural forms with high precision.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does SculptLED Ribbon Flex compare to traditional LED panels?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike rigid LED panels, the Ribbon Flex is ultra-flexible and can form organic shapes and curves, making it perfect for immersive art and architectural features where traditional panels cannot conform.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the brightness level of this LED ribbon, and is it sufficient for daylight viewing?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The product offers 2000 nits of brightness, which provides excellent visibility in both indoor and semi-outdoor environments, though for direct harsh sunlight, additional shading may be advisable.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical warranty period for SculptLED Ribbon Flex?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard 3-year warranty on the SculptLED Ribbon Flex, covering manufacturing defects and ensuring reliable performance throughout its lifespan.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this LED ribbon be integrated into stage design setups?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, its flexibility and high brightness make it ideal for immersive stage design, allowing dynamic lighting effects on curved and sculptural stage elements.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the installation process for complex organic shapes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The LED ribbon\\u2019s flexible design and modular segments simplify installation on curved and irregular surfaces; professional mounting and wiring are recommended to achieve desired forms.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"SculptLED Ribbon Flex\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/sculptled-ribbon-flex\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>SculptLED Ribbon Flex</h1><p>Explore SculptLED Ribbon Flex flexible LED displays in Dubai. Perfect for creative signage. Contact Brightluxx today in UAE for premium LED solutions.</p><p><strong>Flexible LED ribbon for organic sculptural forms.</strong></p><p>Ultra-flexible LED strip that bends to any organic shape. Minimum bend radius of 50mm enables wrapping around columns, creating waves, spirals, and freeform sculptures. Silicone encapsulation provides IP67 waterproofing. Individually addressable pixels allow complex animations across sculptural forms.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the minimum bend radius for SculptLED Ribbon Flex?</h3><p>The SculptLED Ribbon Flex has a minimum bend radius of 50mm, allowing it to wrap smoothly around tight curves such as columns and freeform sculptural shapes.</p><h3>What makes the SculptLED Ribbon Flex suitable for outdoor installations?</h3><p>It features an IP67 rating with silicone encapsulation, ensuring full waterproof and dustproof protection, which makes it ideal for outdoor artistic and architectural installations.</p><h3>How does per-pixel addressability benefit my design?</h3><p>Per-pixel addressability allows you to control each LED individually, enabling complex animations and dynamic visual effects across organic sculptural forms with high precision.</p><h3>How does SculptLED Ribbon Flex compare to traditional LED panels?</h3><p>Unlike rigid LED panels, the Ribbon Flex is ultra-flexible and can form organic shapes and curves, making it perfect for immersive art and architectural features where traditional panels cannot conform.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></div></section><section><h2>EXPLORE</h2><a href=\"/products\">PRODUCTS</a><a href=\"/solutions\">SOLUTIONS</a><a href=\"/technology\">TECHNOLOGY</a><a href=\"/case-studies\">CASE STUDIES</a><a href=\"/blog\">BLOG</a></section><section><h2>LOCATIONS</h2><a href=\"/du