\"name\\\": \\\"Pixel Pitch\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"10mm\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PropertyValue\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightness\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"2000 nits\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PropertyValue\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Warranty\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\\\"}]}14:Ta8b,{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"FAQPage\\\", \\\"mainEntity\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What is the minimum bend radius for SculptLED Ribbon Flex?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"The SculptLED Ribbon Flex has a minimum bend radius of 50mm, allowing it to wrap smoothly around tight curves such as columns and freeform sculptural shapes.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What makes the SculptLED Ribbon Flex suitable for outdoor installations?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"It features an IP67 rating with silicone encapsulation, ensuring full waterproof and dustproof protection, which makes it ideal for outdoor artistic and architectural installations.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How does per-pixel addressability benefit my design?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Per-pixel addressability allows you to control each LED individually, enabling complex animations and dynamic visual effects across organic sculptural forms with high precision.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How does SculptLED Ribbon Flex compare to traditional LED panels?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Unlike rigid LED panels, the Ribbon Flex is ultra-flexible and can form organic shapes and curves, making it perfect for immersive art and architectural features where traditional panels cannot conform.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What is the brightness level of this LED ribbon, and is it sufficient for daylight viewing?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"The product offers 2000 nits of brightness, which provides excellent visibility in both indoor and semi-outdoor environments, though for direct harsh sunlight, additional shading may be advisable.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What is the typical warranty period for SculptLED Ribbon Flex?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Brightluxx offers a standard 3-year warranty on the SculptLED Ribbon Flex, covering manufacturing defects and ensuring reliable performance throughout its lifespan.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Can this LED ribbon be integrated into stage design setups?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Yes, its flexibility and high brightness make it ideal for immersive stage design, allowing dynamic lighting effects on curved and sculptural stage elements.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How is the installation process for complex organic shapes?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"The LED ribbon\\\\u2019s flexible design and modular segments simplify installation on curved and irregular surfaces; professional mounting and wiring are recommended to achieve desired forms.\\\"}}]}9:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$13\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$14\\\"}}],\\\"$L15\\\",\\\"$L16\\\",\\\"$L17\\\"],\\\"$L18\\\"]}]\\n15:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"applic